'''Cavern''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 29th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is icy blue with black patches on it, resembling an ice cavern, hence the name. The guard and handle are solid black, but the handle has tape wrapped around it.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Cavern (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Cavern_Set Cavern Set].

